Package: rsap
Type: Package
Title: SAP RFC Client Without the SAP NW RFC SDK
Version: 2026.11.23
Authors@R: person("Data Zoo", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "info@data-zoo.de")
Description: Call SAP ABAP function modules from R. The RFC protocol is
    implemented in Rust and ships prebuilt, so no SAP NW RFC SDK download, no
    ICU, and no LD_LIBRARY_PATH are needed. Part of ERPL, alongside erpl-pyrfc
    (Python), erpl-gorfc (Go) and erpl-node-rfc (Node.js).
URL: https://erpl.io, https://github.com/DataZooDE/erpl-rsap
BugReports: https://github.com/DataZooDE/erpl-rsap/issues
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
NeedsCompilation: yes
